Add JSON API for LLM agents, preserve filters on edit, update README

- New /api/v1/ JSON API with 9 endpoints for LLM agent consumption:
  accounts, transactions, categories, spending analysis, net worth,
  top merchants, monthly trends, and comprehensive agent context
- Agent context endpoint provides single-call financial snapshot with
  spending patterns, recurring expenses, and data quality metrics
- Transaction edits and bulk operations now redirect back to the same
  filtered page instead of resetting filters
- README rewritten with architecture diagram, LLM integration docs,
  API endpoint table, and updated project structure
